{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-truth-phone-tracker-engine-a-01","date":"2026-11-25","lens":"2","surface":"phone","area":"phone/tracker-engine","refs":["F-phone-908"],"severity":"S3","title":"A member who uses pounds sees the wrong body-weight change","what":"The body-weight change pill is rounded to 0.1 kg first and only then turned into pounds and rounded again. A member who typed 176.4 lb and later 179.1 lb (a real gain of 2.7 lb) is shown '+2.6 lb'. The two weigh-ins on the same page disagree with the change printed next to them, and the gap can be up to about 0.2 lb either way.","expected":"The change is worked out from the two weigh-ins in the member's own unit, so it always equals the difference of the two numbers shown.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/tracker/engine/headline.ts:70","apps/mobile/src/tracker/engine/headline.ts:77-79","apps/mobile/src/lib/units.ts:47-49"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"weight-change-rounded-before-unit","who":"members who use pounds","how_often":"most weigh-in pairs for pound users","fix_line":"Turn both weigh-ins into the member's unit first, then subtract and round once","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-truth-phone-tracker-engine-a-02","date":"2026-11-25","lens":"2","surface":"phone","area":"phone/tracker-engine","refs":["F-phone-901"],"severity":"S3","title":"Ask your own AI tells the AI a new member trains far less often than they do","what":"The text for the member's AI app always divides the workouts by 4 weeks. A member who joined 8 days ago and trained 4 times is described as 'about 1 a week', and the heading still says 'the last 4 weeks'. The AI then answers a question about a once-a-week trainee and may tell a member who trains 4 times a week to train more.","expected":"The weekly rate uses the weeks the member has actually been logging (at least one), and the heading names the real span.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/tracker/engine/aiSummary.ts:92-94"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"ai-summary-fixed-four-week-rate","who":"members in their first 4 weeks who use Ask your own AI","how_often":"every time in the first 4 weeks","fix_line":"Divide by the weeks since the first logged workout in the window, not always 4","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
